---
manual: element.flow
lines: [1996, 2004]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $row = flow do
    @one = stack width: 200 do
      caption "Column one"
      para "is 200 pixels wide"
    end
    @two = stack width: -200 do
      caption "Column two"
      para "is 100% minus 200 pixels wide"
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_instance_of Shoes::Flow, $row, "flow returns a Shoes::Flow"
assert_equal [stack("@one").obj, stack("@two").obj], $row.contents, "the block's elements go inside it, in order"
